flowchart TD
    A((A)) --> Dashboard[Resident Profiling / Household Profile Dashboard]
    Dashboard --> Act{Choose resident feature?}

    Act -- Search / Filter --> List[Search, filter, and sort<br/>resident records]
    List --> Results[Display matching residents]
    Act -- View --> Detail[Open read-only profile<br/>reveal masked PII]
    Act -- Export --> Exp[Export PDF / Excel]
    Act -- Import --> Imp[Upload CSV / XLSX]
    Imp --> ImportReview[Review imported records]
    ImportReview --> Results
    Act -- Add resident --> AddForm[Fill resident form]
    Act -- Edit resident --> EditForm[Open resident form]

    AddForm --> Head{Marked as<br/>Household Head?}
    EditForm --> Head
    Head -- Yes --> Household[Create or select household]
    Head -- No --> Household[Use selected household or none]
    Household --> Results

    Results --> R((R: Dashboard))
    Detail --> R
    Exp --> R
    R --> Dashboard
